<main id="main">
<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-desk.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-desk-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-desk.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/free-claim-calculators/">Calculators</a></li><li aria-current="page">Replacement Cost Holdback Calculator</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">Free calculator</p><h1>Replacement Cost Holdback Calculator (RCV vs. ACV)</h1><p class="lede">Replacement cost policies usually pay in two parts: an actual cash value check now and recoverable depreciation after repairs. Enter your items to see how the money splits.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap">
<div class="tool tool-wide" data-tool="dep">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>Replacement cost holdback calculator</span><i>Add as many items as you need</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <div class="table-wrap items-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Replacement cost ($)</th><th>Age (yrs)</th><th>Life (yrs)</th><th>ACV</th><th><span class="sr-only">Remove</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <tr><td><input name="item" value="Composition roof (30-year)" aria-label="Item"></td><td><input name="rcv" inputmode="decimal" value="21000" aria-label="Replacement cost"></td><td><input name="age" inputmode="decimal" value="11" aria-label="Age in years"></td><td><input name="life" inputmode="decimal" value="30" aria-label="Expected life in years"></td><td class="mono" data-o="row">$0</td><td><button type="button" class="x" aria-label="Remove row">×</button></td></tr><tr><td><input name="item" value="Interior paint, main floor" aria-label="Item"></td><td><input name="rcv" inputmode="decimal" value="2800" aria-label="Replacement cost"></td><td><input name="age" inputmode="decimal" value="5" aria-label="Age in years"></td><td><input name="life" inputmode="decimal" value="10" aria-label="Expected life in years"></td><td class="mono" data-o="row">$0</td><td><button type="button" class="x" aria-label="Remove row">×</button></td></tr><tr><td><input name="item" value="Carpet and pad, bedrooms" aria-label="Item"></td><td><input name="rcv" inputmode="decimal" value="2600" aria-label="Replacement cost"></td><td><input name="age" inputmode="decimal" value="7" aria-label="Age in years"></td><td><input name="life" inputmode="decimal" value="12" aria-label="Expected life in years"></td><td class="mono" data-o="row">$0</td><td><button type="button" class="x" aria-label="Remove row">×</button></td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
      <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn ghost small" data-add data-run>+ Add item</button></div>
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="d-ded">Deductible ($)</label><input id="d-ded" name="deduct" inputmode="decimal" value="1500"></div>
        <div><label for="d-cap">Maximum depreciation</label><select id="d-cap" name="cap"><option value="50">50%</option><option value="70">70%</option><option value="80" selected>80%</option><option value="90">90%</option></select><span class="hint">Many estimates cap depreciation. Check yours.</span></div>
      </div>
      <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="nonrec"> My policy pays actual cash value only (no recoverable depreciation)</label>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out tool-out-3" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="out-big"><small>First check (ACV − deductible)</small><b data-o="first">$0</b></div>
      <div class="out-big"><small>Held back until repairs</small><b data-o="held">$0</b></div>
      <div class="out-big"><small>Total if fully recovered</small><b data-o="total">$0</b></div>
      <div class="out-rows span-all">
        <div><span>Replacement cost (RCV)</span><b data-o="rcv">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Total depreciation</span><b data-o="dep">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Depreciation as share of RCV</span><b data-o="deppct">0%</b></div>
        <div><span>Actual cash value (ACV)</span><b data-o="acv">$0</b></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="hint">For planning only. Results depend on the figures you enter and your policy’s terms. They aren’t a quote, an appraisal or legal advice, and nothing you enter is stored.</p></div></section>
<div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose">
<h2>How depreciation is estimated here</h2>
<p>The calculator uses straight-line depreciation, age divided by expected life, capped at the maximum you choose. Real estimates may adjust for condition, use different life expectancies or treat some items as non-depreciable, so treat the result as a planning figure.</p>
<h2>Typical life expectancies</h2>
<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Common range</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Composition shingles (30-year)</th><td>25–30 years</td></tr><tr><th>Cedar shake roofing</th><td>20–30 years</td></tr><tr><th>Interior paint</th><td>8–12 years</td></tr><tr><th>Carpet</th><td>8–12 years</td></tr><tr><th>Fiber cement siding</th><td>30–50 years</td></tr><tr><th>Water heater</th><td>10–15 years</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h2>Getting holdback released</h2>
<p>Most policies pay recoverable depreciation once repairs are finished within a time limit. Send invoices and photos of the completed work. The <a href="/free-claim-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/">claim timeline planner</a> can remind you before the window closes.</p>
<h2>Questions about this calculator</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Should labor be depreciated?<svg class="ico chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Practice varies by insurer and policy wording. If your estimate depreciates labor, ask the insurer to explain its approach in writing.</p></div></details><details><summary>What if I don’t repair?<svg class="ico chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Under most replacement cost policies, you keep the ACV payment but may not recover the held-back depreciation.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free calculators</h2><div class="cards3 tight"><a class="pcard rv" href="/free-claim-calculators/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Free calculator</span><h3 class="pcard-t">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Calculator</h3><span class="pcard-p">Turn a footprint into true roof squares using pitch and waste, then check the insurer’s figures.</span><span class="pcard-more">Open <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/free-claim-calculators/percentage-deductible-calculator/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/seattle-skyline.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/seattle-skyline-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/seattle-skyline.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Free calculator</span><h3 class="pcard-t">Percentage Deductible Calculator</h3><span class="pcard-p">Turn a percentage earthquake, wind or hail deductible into dollars and see what a claim would pay.</span><span class="pcard-more">Open <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/free-claim-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/"><span class="pcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/clipboard-inspection.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/clipboard-inspection-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/clipboard-inspection.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="pcard-body"><span class="pcard-k">Free planner</span><h3 class="pcard-t">Claim Timeline Planner</h3><span class="pcard-p">Map notice, proof of loss, depreciation and suit-limitation dates from your date of loss, then export them.</span><span class="pcard-more">Open <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></article><aside class="side"><div class="side-in"><div class="side-box call-box"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through, free</h2><p>Tell us what happened and what the insurer offered. We’ll tell you honestly whether appraisal fits.</p><a class="call-num" href="tel:+184453